      en: ["Zarasai received city rights in 1843.", "The radial city plan was implemented starting in 1836.", "The observation bridge has a diameter of 34 meters.", "The Stelmužė oak has a trunk circumference of 13 meters.", "The region encompasses over 300 lakes.", "Zarasai is located just 4 km from the Latvian border."],
